---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
const schema = [
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Word Hunt Guides",
  "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/guides",
  "inLanguage": "en-US",
  "mainEntity": {
   "@type": "ItemList",
   "itemListElement": [
    {
     "@type": "ListItem",
     "position": 1,
     "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/guides/word-hunt-cheat",
     "name": "Word Hunt Cheat Guide"
    },
    {
     "@type": "ListItem",
     "position": 2,
     "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/guides/word-hunt-tips",
     "name": "How to Win at Word Hunt"
    },
    {
     "@type": "ListItem",
     "position": 3,
     "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/guides/word-hunt-solver-vs-word-finder",
     "name": "Word Hunt Solver vs Word Finder vs Word Search Solver"
    },
    {
     "@type": "ListItem",
     "position": 4,
     "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/evolver",
     "name": "Board Evolver"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
   {
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 1,
    "name": "Home",
    "item": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/"
   },
   {
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 2,
    "name": "Guides",
    "item": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/guides"
   }
  ]
 }
];
---

<Layout
  title="Word Hunt Guides: Strategy, Fair Play, and Tools"
  description="Every Word Hunt guide in one place: how to win more rounds, fair ways to use a solver, which word tool fits your puzzle, and practice boards."
  path="/guides"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12 pt-6 sm:pt-8">
    <header id="top" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-brand-400 dark:text-brand-300"><a href="/" class="hover:text-headline">Home</a> / <span aria-current="page">Guides</span></nav>
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-headline dark:text-headline-dark sm:text-4xl">Word Hunt Guides</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Practical guides for GamePigeon Word Hunt players, from fair play to finding longer words. Each guide answers one topic in depth.</p>
    </header>
    <section id="word-hunt-cheat-guide" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Word Hunt Cheat Guide</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"><a href="/guides/word-hunt-cheat" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Word Hunt cheat guide</a>: When a solver is fair, how people cheat, and a cheat sheet of prefixes, suffixes, and short words you can use without any tool.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="how-to-win-at-word-hunt" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V4z"/><path d="M17 5h3v2a3 3 0 0 1-3 3M7 5H4v2a3 3 0 0 0 3 3"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">How to Win at Word Hunt</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"><a href="/guides/word-hunt-tips" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Word Hunt strategy guide</a>: Scoring math, a scanning routine, ways to build longer words, and two real boards we solved, with every word counted.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="comparison-guide-which-word-tool-fits-your-puzzle" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Comparison Guide: Which Word Tool Fits Your Puzzle</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"><a href="/guides/word-hunt-solver-vs-word-finder" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Word tool comparison</a>: Which word tool fits which puzzle, why Word Hunt isn't a word search, and how it compares with Boggle.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="board-evolver" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Board Evolver</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"><a href="/evolver" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Board Evolver</a>: A free tool that builds high scoring practice boards, plus how it works and how to train with it.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="the-solver" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">The Solver</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Stuck on a board right now? Type or upload your letters in <a href="/" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">our free solver</a> and see every word with its path.</p>
</div>
</section>
  </article>
</Layout>
